    <div class="section-header-center reveal">
      <span class="section-tag tag-blue">How it connects</span>
      <h2 class="section-h2 section-h2-light">Signals in. Actions out. <em>Context everywhere.</em></h2>
      <p class="section-sub section-sub-light" style="max-width:540px;margin:0.75rem auto 0;">Most teams stitch together five tools and rebuild context every time. COR connects the loop in one place.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flow-steps">
      <div class="flow-step step-1">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <h3>Build your Blueprint</h3>
        <p>Scan your site or upload a deck. COR extracts your ICP, messaging, positioning, and competitors into a structured Knowledge Base — the shared context every module reads from.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-step step-2">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <h3>Capture live signals</h3>
        <p>Scout LinkedIn for ICP-matched prospects — people already engaging with the problem you solve, ranked before you read a single name. Run AI Presence scans to see where buyers find you (or don't). Pull intelligence from sales calls. Your Blueprint gets smarter automatically.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-step step-3">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <h3>Execute in the same system</h3>
        <p>Write content that closes the gaps — in your voice, with your ICP baked in. Launch outbound from your prospect lists. No tab-switching. No re-pasting context into ChatGPT.</p>
